Return ONLY a JSON object with this exact shape:

{"title": "<wiki title>", "description": "<one sentence>", "topics": [{"name": "<Topic Name>", "source_markers": ["s1", "s4"]}]}

- `source_markers` lists the markers (e.g. "s1") of the sources supporting that
  topic. Only use markers that appear in SOURCES below; never invent one.
- Do not include any text other than the JSON object.
- Do not include ```json``` fences.

